Scope

The MIT licence above covers the code in this repository: the tools, the
runtime, the build files and the documentation.

It does NOT and cannot cover Saints Row itself. The game's code, art, audio and
data belong to their rights holders, are not distributed here, and you need
your own legitimate copy to use any of this.

Code that this project's tools generate from the game is a derivative of it
and is outside the MIT grant for the same reason. It is made from your own
copy and is deliberately not tracked in this repository.
